# Text is stored and checked out with LF on every platform. The git hooks and the
# .claude/hooks scripts run under bash, which breaks on CRLF, and both upstreams are LF, so a
# CRLF working copy made every line differ when diffing against them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pyc binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.mmdb binary
